snippet triangle "Triangle diagram"
	
	               ${1:TOP LINE 1}
	               ${2:TOP LINE 2}
	
	                  /\
	                 /  \
	                /    \
	               /      \
	              /        \
	             /__________\
	
	     ${3:LEFT LINE 1}        ${5:RIGHT LINE 1}
	      ${4:LEFT LINE 2}       ${6:RIGHT LINE 2}
#

snippet nowrap "Lectic: reprint last response without line breaks"
	Thanks! That's what I was looking for. Please reprint your last response without the 78 character line break limit. Write in full prose paragraphs only — no hard wraps mid-sentence or mid-paragraph.
#

snippet zappendix "Zettelkasten cardinal directions appendix"
	## Zettelkasten Appendix

	### West: Similar/Adjacent

	### East: Opposite

	### North: Theme/Questions

	### South: What does this lead to?
